Package: taco
Type: Package
Title: Read TACO Datasets
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Cesar", "Aybar", email = "cesar@asterisk.coop",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: R reader for TACO v3 datasets. Wraps read_taco() in the
    DuckDB cozip extension, so the contract and the metadata are read
    the same way in every language.
